075 \r\nFixes: #124281\r\n\r\n> [!NOTE] \r\n> This PR may seem broken, it is not, the sidebar collapsing was introduced as compact mode in #121387, my other PR #122152 has the fix for that behaviour and it is built on top of this commit for easier testing.\r\n\r\n> [!IMPORTANT]\r\n> This should be cherry-picked for 4.7.3\r\n\r\nExample of PR#122075\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cadbe87c-633e-421f-a0a9-96c31e0cc193\r\n\r\nThis fix\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9d682b01-3379-409b-b45d-b7d90bbeffc0\r\n\r\n\r\n## Aditional Details\r\n\r\nboth `project_title->set_custom_maximum_size()` and `project_title->set_custom_minimum_size()` are used because the project list breaks when on larger editor scales without one or the other present, it is for that same reason they are the same value - if they are different values, which they were in the original PR #129580, broke at higher editor scales on my machine (note, my screen is 14 inches and works with godot at 75% editor scale.)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node